 "remarks": "Rare North Stamford retreat! Set in a private, peaceful setting, this beautifully custom-built Center Hall Colonial is offered with an additional 1.22-acre parcel, creating an exceptional combination of space, privacy, flexibility, and future potential. A dramatic two-story foyer opens to gracious formal living and dining rooms, setting the stage for family celebrations, holiday gatherings, and memorable entertaining. The spacious eat-in kitchen features a sun-filled breakfast area and direct access to the rear deck, ideal for entertaining with family and friends. Just beyond, the inviting family room offers a warm place to gather, while a private first-floor office provides the perfect work-from-home retreat. Upstairs, the expansive primary suite features a generous walk-in closet and en suite bath, joined by three additional spacious bedrooms, two full baths, and an oversized great room ideal for a media room, gym, guest space, or second office. The unfinished walk-out lower level offers even more possibilities. Additional highlights include insulated Andersen windows, a security system, and a full-house generator. A rare opportunity to enjoy the space, privacy, and lifestyle that makes North Stamford so special - and make this beautiful house your home.",
